      "side": 1,
      "message": "One thing that I think is worth pointing out is that the member dma_map_attrs of struct dma_buf_attachment has been introduced by commit f57c5b53d9a2 (\"ANDROID: dma-buf: Add support for mapping buffers with DMA attributes\") with gerrit change-id Ib2e5bafdc02ae31a58ce96a82d77cc508dd71bd4\nAt the time, no code was added to actually pass .dma_map_attrs into dma_map_sg_attrs(). I don\u0027t know whether this was discussed at the time, but I am wondering if there was a reason for not adding this.\nI would consider two things:\n(1) Create a separate patch to pass attachment-\u003edma_map_attrs into dma_map_sg_attrs()\n(2) Make it explicit in the commit message that attachment-\u003edma_map_attrs is now passed into dma_map_sg_attrs() and into dma_unmap_sg_attr() for that matter.",
